import AFTD.Prelude

/-!
# standardized_laplacian_polygon_four

Topic: graphs   Node: d57a7f13edcd

Provenance: formalization of a published result. Source: arXiv:2610.14100 Sec. 2

The polygon S_4 is the convex hull in the complex plane ℂ of the vertices λ_k and their complex conjugates for k ∈ Fin 4, where λ_k = (1/4) ∑_{m=0}^k (1 - (-I)^m).
-/

/-- The convex polygon S_4 in the complex plane generated by the cyclic vertices and their complex conjugates for standardized Laplacians of order 4. -/
noncomputable def standardized_laplacian_polygon_four : Set ℂ := convexHull ℝ ({ (1 / (4 : ℂ)) * ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (k + 1), (1 - (-Complex.I) ^ m) | k : Fin 4 } ∪
    { star ((1 / (4 : ℂ)) * ∑ m ∈ Finset.range (k + 1), (1 - (-Complex.I) ^ m)) | k : Fin 4 })
